"roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:84712","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"C'est moi","creatorId":"vndb:s974","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s974","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s974","name":"C'est moi","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:84714","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c4392","characterName":"藤崎 愛","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"94237","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"266052"}],"egsCharacterIds":["4818"],"vndbCharacterId":"c4392"},"originalCharacterName":"藤崎 愛","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"24"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"167"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Alias \"Steel Shelled Ai\". The beautiful top-rank police investigator leading Team One of O.C.S.A.T, an armed special force countering organized crime. Her body is enhanced with nano machines giving her superhuman abilities and the ability to metalize her limbs as weapons."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4392"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柔らかそうな巨乳ロケットおっぱいとしなやかなくびれボディを持つ美女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『Ｏ.Ｃ.Ｓ.Ａ.Ｔ』、Organized Crime Special Assault Team"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"＝組織犯罪強襲部隊のチーム１を率いる上級捜査官。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特殊なナノマシンで身体機能を飛躍的にブースとした強化人間＜ニュータイプ＞。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"強襲部隊の武装集団の中で軽装で舞うその姿から”鋼殻のアイ”と称される。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大胆な行動力と冷静な洞察力を併せ持つ強襲部隊のエース。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"◆強化カラー：攻性外殻＜ストライククロウ＞"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"意思によって両腕と両脚を鋼鉄化、一時的であるが"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"爪組織の成長させて鋼鉄の爪を武器とする事ができる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「見ての通りの罠よ。まずはこの倉庫を制圧するわよ！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4818","sourceWorkId":"17754","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柔らかな巨乳ロケットおっぱいと、しなやかなくびれボディを持つ美女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『O.C.S.A.T（組織犯罪強襲部隊）』 のチーム1を率いる上級捜査官。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特殊なナノマシンで身体機能を飛躍的にブーストした強化人間（ニュータイプ）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"強襲部隊の武装集団の中で軽装で舞うその姿から、“鋼殻のアイ” と称される。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大胆な行動力と冷静な洞察力を併せ持つ強襲部隊のエース。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"強化カラー：攻性外殻（ストライククロウ）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特殊なナノマシンにより、意思によって両腕と両脚を鋼鉄化でき、さらに爪組織を成長させて鋼鉄の爪を武器とすることができる “鋼殻のアイ” 専用の強化カラー。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"94237"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/aa/aa64edd9cafb02499b6dcb16e0019dfbceb9b888c8a7915072537332855b2e3a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e5831e1e5b42a6513d4e9c087049ba6080c4529310b7a65f036fcb76338e4771.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山川琴美","creatorId":"vndb:s1173","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1173","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1173","name":"山川 琴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:266052:94237:4799:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c4393","characterName":"宮村 由香里","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"94238","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"266052"}],"egsCharacterIds":["4819"],"vndbCharacterId":"c4393"},"originalCharacterName":"宮村 由香里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"166"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The leader of O.C.S.A.T, the armed special forces formed to counter organized crime. She joins the protagonist Ai in her battle against \"Sacrifice\", an criminal organization dealing in international human trafficking. She is respected by Ai who thinks of her as the ideal woman."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4393"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"組織犯罪特捜班の班長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"６つの組織犯罪強襲部隊を束ねる実働部隊のTOP。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛とともに国際的な人身売買組織サクリファイスを追っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"知的な微笑が魅力的な美女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"熟れた抜群のスタイルは男の注意を集めずにはいられないが、全てをサクリファイス壊滅のために捧げてきた静かな情熱家でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛が尊敬し見本とする女性でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「愛、いいわね？　今度こそ奴らの首根っこを掴みなさい」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4819","sourceWorkId":"17754","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"組織犯罪特捜班の班長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"6つの組織犯罪強襲部隊を束ねる実働部隊のトップ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛と共に国際的な人身売買組織 『サクリファイス』 を追っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"知的な微笑が魅力的な美女。 熟れた抜群のスタイルは男の注意を集めずにはいられないが、すべてをサクリファイス壊滅のために捧げてきた静かな情熱家である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛が尊敬し見本とする女性でもある。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"94238"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4a/4a9f4e64ae51f8a410ee57b5d6b948ec859252aed7d551a2da12e926bad5e7bd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/55/5520a39b9d58f0f7b3021cf87e8a57afeac4a7fb8821a68230f7ecf408c33efc.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西沢広香","creatorId":"vndb:s609","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s609","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s609","name":"西沢 広香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:266052:94238:5890:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c4394","characterName":"澤本 美和子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"94239","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"266052"}],"egsCharacterIds":["4820"],"vndbCharacterId":"c4394"},"originalCharacterName":"澤本 美和子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"44"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"170"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chief of Section 9 of the Ministry of Interior Countermeasure Pact. A beautiful woman who doesn't look her age, Miwako is the chief of operations at matters involving countering international organized crime. A former bureaucrat of the Ministry of Defense, she is responsible for contributing to arming the police force with high tech weaponry. Her leadership has shown such effectiveness at reducing organized criminal activity that it has made her a target of a number of assassination attempts. Her prevalence despite this has earned her the nickname of \"The Iron Lady\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Miwako is also the protagonist Ai's biological mother. She possesses a different family name because she divorced soon after giving birth to Ai, and because of this there is some distance in the relationship between mother and daughter. Nonetheless, she shows affection to Ai in her own way, such as arming Ai with the latest technology in nanotech armaments."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4394"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛の母親。内務省条約対策9課の課長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛以上に抜群のスタイルを維持する年齢を感じさせない美女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"9課は国際組織犯罪防止条約の締結によって発足した組織で、その課長は組織犯罪に対する事務方のＴＯＰとなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美和子は元は防衛省のエリート官僚であったが、警察庁と公安庁が合併されて内務省となったときに防衛省から引き抜かれ、警察組織のハイテク武装化に寄与した人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その功績から、9課の課長に抜擢されると豪腕とも揶揄される手法で数々の組織犯罪を壊滅させてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その間、自身命を何度も狙われながらも決然と戦うその姿から鉄の女と称されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛を産んでから離婚し、仕事一筋に生きてきたために娘との距離を感じてはいるが、彼女のなりの方法で愛情を表現している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その最たる例が、陸自が開発した最新テクノロジーであるナノマシンを試験名目で投与させた事である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「愛、久しぶりね。あなたの活躍は宮村さんからよく聞いているわよ」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4820","sourceWorkId":"17754","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛の母親。 内務省条約対策9課の課長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛以上に抜群のスタイルを維持する、年齢を感じさせない美女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"9課は国際組織犯罪防止条約の締結によって発足した組織で、その課長は組織犯罪に対する事務方のトップとなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美和子は元は防衛省のエリート官僚であったが、警察庁と公安庁が合併されて内務省となった時に防衛省から引き抜かれ、警察組織のハイテク武装化に寄与した人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その功績から9課の課長に抜擢されると、豪腕とも称される手法で数々の組織犯罪を壊滅させてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その間、自身命を何度も狙われながらも決然と戦うその姿から、“鉄の女” と称されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛を産んでから離婚し、仕事一筋に生きてきたために娘との距離を感じてはいるが、彼女なりの方法で愛情を表現している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その最たる例が、陸自が開発した最新テクノロジーであるナノマシンを試験名目で投与させたことである。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"94239"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e4a1590172745c284bb3b344dc024bf5d139e9191436afcbac8937283e2e33da.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/25552a13d451e0c4da92e7816a393b3d98a7438396ff69f08fea2ef1d760efb5.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤本教子","creatorId":"vndb:s649","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s649","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s649","name":"平野響子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:266052:94239:5669:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c4395","characterName":"北野 舞","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"94240","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"266052"}],"egsCharacterIds":["4821"],"vndbCharacterId":"c4395"},"originalCharacterName":"北野 舞","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"151"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The daughter of Miyamura's younger sister. A popular idol who has found roles in many different media. She was suddenly kidnapped by criminal organizations while on her job."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Suddenly returned home after a long period absent, she denies being kidnapped and claims that it was her frustration of work that caused her to run away from home. Because of her claims, the investigation was dropped."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4395"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"宮村の妹の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"多数のメディアで活躍するアイドル的な人気子役であったが組織によって誘拐されてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誘拐はかなりの長期間に及ぶがある日突然、家に戻ってくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし誘拐された期間の記憶は曖昧で、本人は仕事が嫌になって家出したと証言し捜査本部は解散、事件は落着を見る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「皆さんごめんなさい！　少しお仕事に疲れて一人で旅をしてました！」."}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4821","sourceWorkId":"17754","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"宮村の妹の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"多数のメディアで活躍するアイドル的な人気子役であったが、組織によって誘拐されてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誘拐はかなりの長期間に及ぶがある日突然、家に戻ってくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし誘拐された期間の記憶は曖昧で、本人は仕事が嫌になって家出したと証言し捜査本部は解散、事件は落着を見る。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"94240"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/df6d201609cae85ddc36f4da321f6de2fa30e1b9266a754770c883acc486ce63.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e8/e8124d55ea7fff63d74c288005590c4eab4bedb534683c55f197f6e90e15de03.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"青葉りんご","creatorId":"vndb:s295","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s295","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s295","name":"青葉 りんご","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:266052:94240:5922:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43